{
  "name": "dsh-ui-three-body",
  "version": "0.3.0-rc.2",
  "description": "驯兽师（驯兽场）：把人类语言翻译给智能体的 DSH 插件——注入「开智」内核（第一性原理 + 需求剖析 + 极简沟通 + 最少 token），左上角悬浮萌宠，设置页可配内核与开关。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/EternalNight996/dsh-ui-three-body.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/EternalNight996/dsh-ui-three-body",
  "author": "EternalNight996",
  "publishConfig": {
    "registry": "https://registry.npmjs.org/"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "lib/kernel.js",
    "lib/settings-host.js",
    "lib/state-route.js",
    "lib/http-json.js",
    "lib/client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22",
    "dsh": ">=0.1.5-alpha.2 <0.3.0"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "plugin",
    "agent-training",
    "prompt-engineering",
    "first-principles",
    "beast-tamer",
    "system-prompt"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node build.mjs",
    "build:client": "node build.mjs",
    "prepublishOnly": "node build.mjs",
    "test": "node --test tests/*.test.mjs",
    "sync": "node scripts/sync-profile.mjs"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.1"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": ">=4.0.1 <5.0.0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": ">=0.1.0-rc.7 <0.3.0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": ">=0.1.0-rc.7 <0.3.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "esbuild": "^0.24.0",
    "@types/react": "^18.3.1"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ]
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "compatibility": {
      "dsh": ">=0.1.5-alpha.2 <0.3.0",
      "node": ">=22",
      "profiles": [
        "web",
        "desktop"
      ],
      "dshReleases": {
        "0.1.5-alpha.2": "compatible",
        "0.1.5-rc.2": "compatible",
        "0.1.7-rc.2": "compatible",
        "0.2.0-rc.1": "compatible",
        "0.2.0-rc.2": "compatible"
      },
      "notes": "真正被 DSH 强制校验的只有 peerDependencies 里的 @deepseek-ai/dsh-* 范围（packages/boot/app-boot/src/plugin-compatibility.ts），本块仅供人类阅读与市场展示。0.2.0 起 settings 命名空间注册 API 被 SettingsForms 取代，host 侧经 lib/settings-host.js 做形状嗅探适配，client 侧经 src/client/settings-adapter.js 适配。"
    }
  }
}
